  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Shelter Response for Displaced Populations in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, IOM, in coordination with OCHA Ethiopia and the shelter and non-food items cluster, is providing urgently needed shelter repair support for internally displaced persons in Ethiopia who have recently returned to their areas of origin in Oromia &#x2013; East Wellega, West Guji zone, East Harerge zone, Somali &#x2013; Dawa Zone. Assistance includes delivery of emergency shelter repair kits, basic carpenter training, and housing, land and property verification support. Implementation is being carried out by IOM and six identified partner NGOs with operational presence and shelter expertise in the prioritized locations.</narrative>
  </description>
